Dashboard widget listing the active DHCP leases of every running
DHCP server in a single table: ISC DHCP (v4/v6), Kea DHCP (v4/v6)
and Dnsmasq DHCP. Columns: IP address, hostname, MAC address,
manufacturer, interface, lease type, server and online status.
All columns are sortable and can be shown or hidden in the widget options.

Inspired by the legacy dHCP_leases.widget.php by Tonton Jo.

